  --async {0,1}         Enable async execution (default: 1, enabled). Set to 0
                        to disable async mode, 1 to enable it. Type: int
  --communicator {nccl,native,cuda-ipc}
                        Communication backend for multi-GPU inference. The
                        "native" option is deprecated and serves as an alias
                        for "cuda-ipc". Default: nccl. Type: str
  --moe-a2a-backend {auto,default,deepep}
                        Communication backend for MoE all-to-all. The "auto"
                        option selects "default" for single-node inference and
